  "best_idea": "Score every candidate action by summing per-target values, where ally hits subtract value scaled by a weight that depends on how many allies and enemies are still alive, then keep the best candidate only if it beats the current one by a margin.",
  "decision": "adapt",
  "decision_why": "The rating shape (enemy value positive, ally harm weighted by living-count ratio, kill bonus, margin before switching) is reusable for choosing an attack or AoE option in a many-on-one fight; the artillery trajectory tracing and per-weapon ammo tests do not fit a fast duel.",
  "decision_status": "proposed",
